# 3. ACCORDION BEHAVIOR

Questions should expand/collapse.

Use:

* Plus icon when closed
* Minus icon when open

The icon should rotate or transition subtly.

Opening an answer should animate with a restrained height/opacity transition.

Do NOT use:

* bouncing
* dramatic scaling
* flashy transitions

Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.

